    de "噢噢！"

# game/scripts/freeroam/episode1/ep1_freeroam_dorm.rpy:437
translate schinese fr_ep1_mc_dorm_hall_label_nofx_e70d4767:

    # de "Hehe! You got me!"
    de "嘿嘿！你抓到我了！"

# game/scripts/freeroam/episode1/ep1_freeroam_dorm.rpy:439
translate schinese fr_ep1_mc_dorm_hall_label_nofx_51681341:

    # de "So, what are you up to?"
    de "那么，你在忙什么？"

# game/scripts/freeroam/episode1/ep1_freeroam_dorm.rpy:441
translate schinese fr_ep1_mc_dorm_hall_label_nofx_7ac2f966:

    # mc "Not much, just walking around trying to figure this place out."
    mc "没什么，就是到处走走，摸清这个地方。"

# game/scripts/freeroam/episode1/ep1_freeroam_dorm.rpy:442
translate schinese fr_ep1_mc_dorm_hall_label_nofx_09afb406:

    # mc "How about you?"
    mc "你呢？"

# game/scripts/freeroam/episode1/ep1_freeroam_dorm.rpy:444
translate schinese fr_ep1_mc_dorm_hall_label_nofx_a139d2a2:

    # de "I'm trying to find out who's really in charge of this place."
    de "我在查这地方到底是谁说了算。"

# game/scripts/freeroam/episode1/ep1_freeroam_dorm.rpy:446
translate schinese fr_ep1_mc_dorm_hall_label_nofx_b2b9e19d:

    # mc "What do you mean?"
    mc "你什么意思？"

# game/scripts/freeroam/episode1/ep1_freeroam_dorm.rpy:448
translate schinese fr_ep1_mc_dorm_hall_label_nofx_c26a70a1:

    # de "Well, rumor has it that there's more to this place than what it appears to be."
    de "嗯，有传言说这地方不止表面上这么简单。"

# game/scripts/freeroam/episode1/ep1_freeroam_dorm.rpy:449
translate schinese fr_ep1_mc_dorm_hall_label_nofx_cdf3e6f8:

    # de "I'm trying to find out who's calling the shots and how to get in on the action."
    de "我在查谁在幕后操纵，以及怎么才能分一杯羹。"

# game/scripts/freeroam/episode1/ep1_freeroam_dorm.rpy:451
translate schinese fr_ep1_mc_dorm_hall_label_nofx_a919f73d:

    # mc "That doesn't really explain anything..."
    mc "这什么也没解释清楚啊……"

# game/scripts/freeroam/episode1/ep1_freeroam_dorm.rpy:452
translate schinese fr_ep1_mc_dorm_hall_label_nofx_da3ad8cc:

    # mc "Calling the shots on what? What action?"
    mc "操纵什么？分什么羹？"

# game/scripts/freeroam/episode1/ep1_freeroam_dorm.rpy:454
translate schinese fr_ep1_mc_dorm_hall_label_nofx_1d43d470:

    # de "Open your eyes, I think you'd see that there's something weird going on if you just look hard enough."
    de "睁大眼睛，只要你仔细看，就会发现这里有些不对劲的地方。"

# game/scripts/freeroam/episode1/ep1_freeroam_dorm.rpy:455
translate schinese fr_ep1_mc_dorm_hall_label_nofx_3c475d2c:

    # de "I mean, how can the HOTs afford to pay tuition for the freshies?"
    de "我是说，HOT 他们哪来的钱给新生交学费？"

# game/scripts/freeroam/episode1/ep1_freeroam_dorm.rpy:456
translate schinese fr_ep1_mc_dorm_hall_label_nofx_e90ed693:

    # de "Why do the security guards treat some people differently?"
    de "为什么保安对某些人的态度不一样？"

# game/scripts/freeroam/episode1/ep1_freeroam_dorm.rpy:463
translate schinese fr_ep1_mc_dorm_hall_label_nofx_a19d2ac7:

    # mc "Hm..."
    mc "嗯……"

